  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v1.1.0 (major)\n\n- Make every source header match the copyright template ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Adopt ktsu.TrayApp and delete what it now owns ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- [patch] Correct the CLAUDE.md note about the test helper processes ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))\n- [patch] Fix ChildProcessHoldTests on macOS: /bin/false is Linux-only ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))\n- [minor] Add NoSleep, a cross-platform keep-awake tool with a system tray icon ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))\n- Initial commit ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))",
